**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.git
**/reports
**/benchmark-results
# Never bake local secrets into an image: backend/.env is git-ignored, but the
# Docker build context is the filesystem, not git, and app/config.py loads
# `.env` relative to the WORKDIR the image runs from.
**/.env
!**/.env.example
